The Carnival Manager: [#portrait=manager_default]We about to have a carnival soon. A carnival for the liar. And I need you to do some little work for me.
The Carnival Manager: [#portrait=manager_default]As you can guess from the name, the game stall owners at the carnival wont be truthfully with us. That why I have these psychology reports.
The Carnival Manager: [#portrait=manager_default]These reports is to know each stall owners preference when it come to lying.
The Carnival Manager: [#portrait=manager_happy]The thing is, I must have dropped the name label somewhere. Tee hee!
The Carnival Manager: [#portrait=manager_default]So, can you go overthere, ask or observe them, and [color=yellow]attach a name to each paper[/color]?
